# Pairs with OrphanEventuallyRetired. A protocol defect with fairness intact: a run
# may finish before it has decided every pin it found, so a sweep that always does
# never retires anything.
MODULE: OrphanEventuallyRetiredDoneSkipsDecisions
TARGET: OrphanEventuallyRetired
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a run finishes without deciding the pins it found
PERTURBS: Done

--- FIND
    /\ \A c \in Cons : found[p][c] = {}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: undecided pins do not hold the run open.
    /\ TRUE
--- END
